<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CG Smith Foods warns of slower 2nd half.</title>
<headline>CG Smith Foods warns of slower 2nd half.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>CG Smith Foods Ltd said on Thursday that current weakness in consumer demand was expected to persist for the balance of the year and it was therefore unlikely that earnings growth for the full year would match the first six months.</p>
<p>CG Smith Ltd also cautioned that earnings growth was likely to slow.  </p>
<p>CG Smith Foods reported headline earnings growth of 17 percent in the first half to March 31 while CG Smith advanced 13 percent.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
